<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-053" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong" source-id="s-sanguozhi-053-zhichong">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030:m0002" ref="eus_x4z_ogu">秉</persName>為傅時，率更令河南<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030:m0012" ref="jom_vh0_r1s">徵崇</persName>亦篤學立行云。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030-pei01-01" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">吳錄曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030-pei01-01:m0004" ref="jom_vh0_r1s">崇</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030-pei01-01:m0006" ref="jom_vh0_r1s">子和</persName>，治《易》《春秋左氏傳》，兼善內術。本姓李，遭亂更姓，遂隱於會稽，躬耕以求其志。好尚者從學，所教不過數人輒止，欲令其業必有成也。所交結如丞相<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030-pei01-01:m0078" ref="snv_2iq_jes">步騭</persName>等，咸親焉。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030-pei01-01:m0086" ref="szg_rhg_18d">嚴畯</persName>薦<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030-pei01-01:m0089" ref="jom_vh0_r1s">崇</persName>行足以厲俗，學足以為師。初見<persName id="c-sanguozhi-053-zhichong:line030-pei01-01:m0104" ref="572_278_cba_C">太子登</persName>，以疾賜不拜。東宮官僚皆從諮詢。太子數訪以異聞。年七十而卒。</p>
</text>
